# Cripple Creek: Scruggs-style arrangement written fresh for this app (DEVELOPMENT.md §10).
# A part: high melody on strings 1–3. B part: the same tune starting on the open 2nd string.
m1  G          middle-leading+pull-off  | 1:0M* 2:0I 1:0M* 5:0T 3:2I* p3:0* 4:2T* 1:0M |
m2  G          lick:hammer-ons          | 3:0T* 2:0I 3:0T* h3:2* 2:0I* 1:0M 2:0T* h2:1* |
m3  G D@5      middle-leading+pull-off  | 1:0M* 2:0I 1:0M* 5:0T 3:2I* p3:0* 4:2T* 1:0M |
m4  G          lick:pinch-fill          | 3:0T* 2:0I 3:0T* 2:0I [3:0T*,1:0M] - - 5:0T |
m5  G          index-leading+pull-off   | 2:0I* 1:0M 2:0T* 1:0M 3:2I* p3:0* 4:2T* 1:0M |
m6  C G@5      lick:hammer-ons          | 3:0T* 2:1I 3:0T* h3:2* 2:0I* 1:0M 3:4T* 1:0M |
m7  G D@5      index-leading+pull-off   | 2:0I* 1:0M 2:0T* 1:0M 3:2I* p3:0* 4:2T* 1:0M |
m8  G          lick:pinch-fill          | 3:0T* 2:0I 3:0T* 2:0I [3:0T*,1:0M] - - 5:0T |
